    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_agroprom:agr_stalker_esc_20#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_agroprom",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_agroprom.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 102,
      "string_id": "agr_stalker_esc_20",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I'm coming back from the factory which is a bit further down the road. I don't know how but the army found out about our group. I didn't wait for them to show up and took off as quickly as I could. I hope our boys got out of there 'cause otherwise they won't be alive for much longer - you saw the choppers yourself.",
      "JA_current": "この道の先の工場から、今逃げてきたところだ。どうやってかは知らんが、軍の連中が俺たちの居場所を嗅ぎつけた。俺は奴らがやってくる前に、大急ぎで脱出してきたんだ。仲間もうまく逃げてくれてたらいいが。さもなきゃみんな死ぬ。あんたも奴らのヘリを見たろう？",
      "JA_new": "少し先にある工場から戻るところだ。どういうわけか軍に俺たちの集団が見つかった。連中が来る前に急いで逃げたよ。仲間も無事に逃げてるといいが……さもないと、もう長くはない。あんたもヘリを見ただろ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
